{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：22:56 2026-10-22 HKT</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/91560b2833df6b1d9c4b454ad98cb5dc/2026-10/duo_.jpg\"/>\n<p>蘋果首款全新摺機 Apple iPhone Duo明日（23日）發售，首批預購客戶可於早上8時起取機。有先達商戶透露，由於有部分原定在明日取機的市民，被蘋果推遲到收貨日期，故預料細機256GB的炒價會再升，每部機水位或可高達5,000元。《星島頭條》記者會繼續直擊iPhone Duo放售回收價，持續更新各款容量、顏色的炒價走勢。</p>\n<h2>指iPhone Duo新機供應減少 256GB炒價或高達五千</h2>\n<p>先達商戶、幸福電訊負責人Steve透露，先達暗盤價已出爐，原封未激活的256GB版本水位可達5000元、512GB則至少賺3000元。他解釋，得悉有客人原定明日收機，卻被蘋果推遲收貨日期；加上據了解今次貨量很多去了電訊商，變相令原封、未激活的新機供應減少。他表示，出口至外地的必須是原封機，故回收價突然增加，與已開封機的水位可相差2000元。</p>\n<p>另一先達商戶Simon早前亦分析，如果能在首天取貨，「第一水基本上無得輸」，估計細機256GB和512GB「賺三四千」無問題 ，不過水位能否再度上漲，他則稱不敢「寫包單」 。</p>\n<img alt=\"先達商戶、幸福電訊負責人Steve透露，先達暗盤價已出爐，原封未激活的256GB版本水位可達5000元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/64b162ed49e4ec569489f5ce33c981cd/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-22_at_10_53_27_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘋果全新摺機Apple iPhone Duo首批最快可於10月23日門市取機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1024b9154a8f41e418fdaf470bb2db79/2026-10/2026-10-13_113611_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「收機聖地」旺角先達廣場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b44b0561c13bac261fd3ff2649e9d072/2026-10/0689468435132.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘋果首款全新摺機 Apple iPhone Duo今日（23日）發售。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eafb3acf161846f76cf3aff012a623da/2026-10/1321321.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"iPhone Duo 本港售價介乎17499元（256GB）至最貴27,999元（2TB）。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/15501a0e6946f61230ff8df7662b6494/2026-10/2026-10-14_152946_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"其「矜貴」的摺疊內螢幕，若無買Apple Care，內顯示器損壞的維修費為8,749元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ed2a5a8d7883c7ac013efb2218432b4b/2026-10/2026-09-10_180222_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘋果iPhone 18 Pro 系列9月18日開售，先達人頭湧湧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff87f0d62c7fb39c77087445a56a802c/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"從各區Apple Store取貨的人潮蜂擁至先達，放機市民從場內倒灌至門外、人龍沿通菜街延綿至快富街交界。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b9bd26cfb5af0665ac0a7064f63f53b/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_130110796_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"據現場價單，當時原價16799元的iPhone 18 Pro Max 1TB，炒價高見19500元，換言之每部機淨賺2700元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/80ebcfa37320771506e3097366a400bf/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-18_at_1_27_53_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"蘋果iPhone 18 系列9月18日開售，先達人頭湧湧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae397fddfa076114d52ff9049461b772/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"先達廣場人湧現放機人潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/14c8d54dae3b37748238ca1e53b90218/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_09.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1012b82bff5b3b9b3a8e2915a6e61ce/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-18_at_1_28_26_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"原價16799元的iPhone 18 Pro Max 1TB，炒價高見19500元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b25a7f030b139af8b20dd33430264f2/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"先達廣場人湧現放機人潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f849ba51a5110a62b1878b602afeb236/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不少人到先達放機。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dae32cdc139ad06879b9cb98b66f8ca5/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_122315280_11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"先達門外亦有不少收機黨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2afa2523f3f1fe83020a52ecde0b009e/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_130110796.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"先達門外亦有不少收機黨。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/538b9b49227f8709f097ec883a7e3900/2026-09/KakaoTalk_20260918_130110796_01.jpg\"/>\n<p>記者：陳俊豪</p>\n<p>攝影：葉偉豪</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.300650+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":496,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:56:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T20:18:15.441713+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.258304+00:00","content_hash":"8d6ba20637580e76f74d2ad79d73d68bfabe513c921c7b51741c18ad4acf24e6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}